{c: Verse 1}
[G]Badi mushkil hai,        [G]khoya mera dil hai,
[G]Koi usay dhoondke [D]laaye naa,        [C]Jaakay kahaan main
[D]rapatt likhaun,        [G]Koi batlaaye [D]naa
Main rooun ya ha [C]soo [D]n,        karoon main kya ka [G]roon
Main rooun ya ha [C]soo [D]n,        karoon main kya ka [G]roon
Deewan [G]gi ki haad se [D] ,        aagay gu [C]zar na jaaun [G] .
Aankhon mein uska cheh [D]ra,        kaise u [C]say dikhlaaun [G]
Deewan [G]gi ki haad se [D] ,        aagay gu [C]zar na jaaun [G] .
Aankhon mein uska cheh [D]ra,        kaise u [C]say dikhlaaun [G]
[G]Woh [D]hai, [C]sab se ha [G]seen,        [G]wai [D]sa, [C]koi bhi na [G]hin
[C]Mere khooda, [G]uski adaa,        [D]hai badi [C]quaatill.
[D]Mujhe nahin pa [C]taa;        chh [D]aaya hai kya na [G]shaa
