Sapnoon mein [G]aane waali [D] ,        baahon mein [C]kab aayegi [G] .
Kitne dino tak mujhko [D] ,        aise woh [C]tadpaayeg [G]i
Sapnoon mein [G]aane waali [D] ,        baahon mein [C]kab aayegi [G] .
Kitne dino tak mujhko [D] ,        aise woh [C]tadpaayeg [G]i
[G]De.. [D]khoon, [C]mudke ji [G]dhar,        [G]aa.. [D]ye [C]woh hi na [G]zaar
[C]Meri dagar, [G]mera safar,        [D]woh meri man [C]zil.
[D]Deewaana hai sa [C]maa;        [D]jaage hain arm [G]aan!
